{"comments":[{"x":464.0,"y":1056.0,"text":"older"},{"x":96.0,"y":176.0,"text":"newer"}],"camx":1251.166748046875,"camy":833.5,"starting_node":25.0,"events":[],"textboxes":[{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":672.0,"portrait_ind":18.0,"y":1184.0,"connect0_ID":1.0,"ID":0.0,"text":"It's probably related to that \"Wizardtopia\" thing he mentioned."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_bridget)","x":1072.0,"portrait_ind":20.0,"y":1200.0,"connect0_ID":11.0,"ID":1.0,"text":"An evil beam of light might be out of our skill-set."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":928.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"y":1648.0,"ID":2.0,"text":"<nopause>Let's go see Dr. Zig<yespause>, that guy's a freakin' genius. He'd know what to do!"},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":432.0,"portrait_ind":7.0,"y":1200.0,"connect0_ID":0.0,"ID":3.0,"text":"That light in the sky can't be good."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":1104.0,"portrait_ind":7.0,"y":1328.0,"connect0_ID":5.0,"ID":4.0,"text":"This seems more, like, science-y."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":1168.0,"portrait_ind":54.0,"y":1424.0,"connect0_ID":6.0,"ID":5.0,"text":"Hmmm..."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_bridget)","x":1056.0,"portrait_ind":23.0,"y":1424.0,"connect0_ID":7.0,"ID":6.0,"text":"Hmmm..."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":1056.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"y":1520.0,"connect0_ID":8.0,"ID":7.0,"text":"Wait! We know a scientist."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_bridget)","x":672.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"y":1504.0,"connect0_ID":9.0,"ID":8.0,"text":"Oh yeah! <nopause>Dr. Zig<yespause>! That guy's a genius. He'd definitely know what to do."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":272.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"y":1504.0,"connect0_ID":10.0,"ID":9.0,"text":"There's a subway stop around his lab.<break>If we're quick, we could catch a train."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_bridget)","x":272.0,"portrait_ind":6.0,"y":1680.0,"connect0_ID":12.0,"ID":10.0,"text":"Perfect! Then we'll find the nearest subway station."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":1440.0,"portrait_ind":51.0,"y":1184.0,"connect0_ID":4.0,"ID":11.0,"text":"Yeahhh... not too sure if we can really blow that up."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":352.0,"portrait_ind":1.0,"y":1744.0,"ID":12.0,"text":"Let's book it!"},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":496.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"y":512.0,"connect0_ID":14.0,"ID":13.0,"text":"Okay. First order of business, we blow up that sky thingie."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":896.0,"portrait_ind":25.0,"y":512.0,"connect0_ID":15.0,"ID":14.0,"text":"Then we go home, get out of these work clothes, and make a sandwich."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_bridget)","x":1360.0,"portrait_ind":74.0,"y":512.0,"connect0_ID":16.0,"ID":15.0,"text":"I'm not too sure we can really blow that up."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_bridget)","x":1712.0,"portrait_ind":76.0,"y":512.0,"connect0_ID":17.0,"ID":16.0,"text":"Don't it seem kinda... mystical?"},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":1632.0,"portrait_ind":8.0,"y":640.0,"connect0_ID":18.0,"ID":17.0,"text":"What else we supposed to do? We're a wrecking crew, not rocket scientists."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_bridget)","x":1312.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"y":656.0,"connect0_ID":19.0,"ID":18.0,"text":"Wait, we know a <col zig>scientist<col white>!"},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":1184.0,"portrait_ind":7.0,"y":656.0,"connect0_ID":20.0,"ID":19.0,"text":"We do?"},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":800.0,"portrait_ind":2.0,"y":640.0,"connect0_ID":21.0,"ID":20.0,"text":"Wait, you're right! <nopause><col zig>Dr. Zig<col white><yespause>!"},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":384.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"y":640.0,"connect0_ID":22.0,"ID":21.0,"text":"Zig's a freakin' genius, he'd know what that thing in the sky is."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":368.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"y":800.0,"connect0_ID":23.0,"ID":22.0,"text":"There's a <col yellow>subway stop<col white> around his lab.<break>If we're quick, we could catch a train."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_bridget)","x":896.0,"portrait_ind":6.0,"y":816.0,"connect0_ID":24.0,"ID":23.0,"text":"Perfect! Then we'll head to the nearest <col yellow>subway station<col white>."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":1312.0,"portrait_ind":1.0,"y":800.0,"ID":24.0,"text":"Those trains leave wicked fast,<break>so let's book it!"},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":96.0,"portrait_ind":21.0,"y":256.0,"connect0_ID":33.0,"ID":25.0,"text":"Worked a nine hour shift just to deal with this. Real nice."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":2048.0,"portrait_ind":21.0,"y":576.0,"ID":26.0,"text":"At this point I'd take my chances, my feet are killing me."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_bridget)","x":1904.0,"portrait_ind":72.0,"y":-320.0,"connect0_ID":28.0,"ID":27.0,"text":"Wish he picked a better time to take over the world."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_bridget)","x":2288.0,"portrait_ind":79.0,"y":-320.0,"ID":28.0,"text":"I was looking forward to gettin' all cozy in bed."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_bridget)","x":960.0,"portrait_ind":21.0,"y":224.0,"ID":29.0,"text":"That thing in the sky...<break>What is it?"},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":560.0,"portrait_ind":22.0,"y":240.0,"connect0_ID":31.0,"ID":30.0,"text":"Didn't you hear him?<break>That's Wizardtopia."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_bridget)","x":512.0,"portrait_ind":17.0,"y":336.0,"connect0_ID":32.0,"ID":31.0,"text":"Oh. Is it? I assumed that's the thing that's going to MAKE Wizardtopia."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":960.0,"portrait_ind":2.0,"y":336.0,"connect0_ID":34.0,"ID":32.0,"text":"<textspd 0.25>Ohhhhhhhhh."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_bridget)","x":544.0,"portrait_ind":44.0,"y":64.0,"connect0_ID":30.0,"ID":33.0,"text":"Should we be worried about that purple sky thing? What the heck was that?"},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":1328.0,"portrait_ind":39.0,"y":336.0,"connect0_ID":13.0,"ID":34.0,"text":"Yeah, that would make more sense."}],"ID_TOTAL":35.0,"cam_zoom_count":1.0,"choices":[],"portraits":[]}